\f0\fs22 ro0tLimiter setup\par
\par
This setup installs ro0tLimiter for 64-bit Windows.\par
\par
If the .NET 8 Desktop Runtime is not already installed, the setup downloads it from Microsoft and installs it. An internet connection is required only in that case.\par
\par
The packet-capture library and its driver are included in this setup. They are covered by the license shown on the next page.\par
\par
The program asks for administrator permission because it filters network traffic.\par
